            This is really an easy song to play with some difficult looking chord names.
I bar the Bb on the 6th fret and use my my pinky to add the 7th.  Same with the Ab,
except on the 4th fret.  For the Eb, I finger a C chord on the 6th fret, muting the
high and low E strings and add the 7th again with my pinky.  He plays a couple of
other chords during the bridge parts, but I have yet to get them.  Happy picking!

